<h3 id="h3_content_1_24" class="heading-after-first">太鼓の達人(バンダイナムコ)  <a class="anchor_super" name ="o39cd911"></a> <a class="anchor_super" href="/deemo/::cmd/edit?page=SandBox&id=o39cd911" rel='nofollow'><span class="system-icon paraedit" title="Edit"></span></a></h3>
