<a href="/deemo/Saika" title="Saika" class="rel-wiki-page">Saika</a>(<a class="ext" href="https://taikops4-ses.taiko-ch.net/dlc/" rel="nofollow">無料DLC<span class="system-icon ext pukiwiki-open-uri" data-href="https://taikops4-ses.taiko-ch.net/dlc/" data-frame="_blank"></span></a>)<br />
